    <string name="hc_main_mirror_ready_msg">Entire screen — best for riding. Uses Setup ▸ Screen fit and Setup ▸ Mirror orientation (Match dash rotates the phone so the TFT fills).\n\nSingle app — that app must stay on screen; Android sends no frames in the background. Prefer GPX / Tracks or Android Auto for pocket use.\n\nBike touch does not drive mirrored apps. Continue connects and sends OpenCfMoto to the background.</string>
    <string name="hc_main_bike_search_open">Bike search open — type here. Results appear on the dash.</string>
    <string name="hc_main_rival_msg">The official CFMoto/EasyConnect app is running and holding the bike\'s link ports, so the dash stays blank. Close it, then reconnect.\n\n\"Close &amp; retry\" tries to stop it for you; if the dash is still blank, use \"App settings\" and tap Force stop.</string>
    <string name="hc_main_close_retry">Close &amp; retry</string>
    <string name="hc_main_rival_unknown_msg">Something is holding the bike\'s link ports (10920-10922). Close any other CFMoto/EasyConnect app and reconnect.</string>
    <string name="hc_main_vpn_title">VPN is blocking the bike</string>
    <string name="hc_main_vpn_msg">Android Auto reached the phone, but a VPN kill-switch is blocking the bike Wi‑Fi (Network.bindSocket → EPERM).\n\nFix (any one):\n• Turn the VPN off for this ride\n• Disable Always-on VPN → \"Block connections without VPN\"\n• Allow LAN / local network in the VPN app (PCAPdroid, AdGuard, etc.)\n\nThen tap Connect again.</string>
