    <string name="hc_misc_preset_five_way_summary">◀/▶ = knob (move) · ◀◀/▶▶ = D-pad ←/→ (into apps) · ★ = Select · ★★ = Back · ★ hold = Home. Singles fire immediately (no lag waiting for ×2).</string>
    <string name="hc_misc_preset_mode_ent_title">MODE / ENT cluster</string>
    <string name="hc_misc_preset_mode_ent_summary">Same AA navigation as 5-way: knob · ×2 = D-pad ←/→ · ★★ = Back. Singles are snappy; a second tap in the window still fires ×2.</string>
    <string name="hc_misc_preset_back_set_title">BACK / SET diamond (limited)</string>
    <string name="hc_misc_preset_back_set_summary">Snappy singles (no double-tap wait). Discrete hold / Select ×2 usually don\'t exist — but a hard ▲▲ / ▼▼ volume flick often coalesces into ×2 → Back / Home. On-screen pad covers anything else.</string>
